<section>
<h2>5. Important Terms</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Dimension:</b> Numerical measurement of an object.</li>
<li><b>Scale:</b> Ratio between drawing size and actual size.</li>
<li><b>Projection:</b> Representation of an object on a plane.</li>
<li><b>Centre Line:</b> Indicates the centre or axis of an object.</li>
<li><b>Drawing Plane:</b> Surface on which a drawing is represented.</li>
</ul>
</section>

